  "visual": {
    "visualType": "textbox",
    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "513,801 road collisions reported to the police in Great Britain from January 2021 to December 2025, with the 652,821 casualties and 937,265 vehicles they involved. Only collisions in which someone was injured are recorded, and they are recorded by the police, so damage-only collisions and many slight injuries are missing. To keep the report light the collisions were grouped: every row is the number of collisions (and their casualties and vehicles) that share the same month, weekday, hour, police force, severity, road class, road type, speed limit, light, weather, road surface and urban or rural area, so a row is not one collision and the Details page shows these groups. Nothing was dropped or sampled: the totals of the groups equal the totals of the file. The date is the first day of the month. Severity is the police's own (fatal, serious, slight) and the fatal or serious share counts collisions, not casualties. The police force is the force that recorded the collision (Police Scotland covers Scotland; Northern Ireland is not in the data); the dots on the map sit at the middle of each force's collisions, not at its headquarters. A few collisions list very many casualties (the largest lists 142), which lifts the average a little.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to use it",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Open the Filters pane on the right (the funnel tab) to filter by category or date; the selection applies to every page. Click a bar, a slice or a point to cross-filter the other charts, and hover over one to see a small summary card.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Data source",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Department for Transport, Road Safety Data (STATS19), collision file for the last 5 years (https://data.dft.gov.uk/road-accidents-safety-data/dft-road-casualty-statistics-collision-last-5-years.csv), retrieved on 30 October 2026. The DfT statistics pages on GOV.UK are published under the Open Government Licence v3.0; no licence line was found on the data file itself. Prepared: the codes were turned into words (the standard STATS19 codes; the police force names were checked against the positions of the collisions of each force), the hour was taken from the time, the collisions were grouped as described above, and the middle of each force's collisions was added for the map.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Measures",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "15pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Records = COUNTROWS(RoadCollisions)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Collisions = SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Casualties = SUM(RoadCollisions[Casualty_count])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Fatal collisions = CALCULATE(SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]), RoadCollisions[Severity] = \"1 Fatal\")",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Serious collisions = CALCULATE(SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]), RoadCollisions[Severity] = \"2 Serious\")",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Fatal or serious share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]), RoadCollisions[Severity] <> \"3 Slight\"), SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Casualties per collision = DIVIDE(SUM(RoadCollisions[Casualty_count]), SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Vehicles per collision = DIVIDE(SUM(RoadCollisions[Vehicle_count]), SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Dark share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]), RoadCollisions[Light] <> \"Daylight\", RoadCollisions[Light] <> \"Not listed\"), SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Wet or icy share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]), RoadCollisions[Surface] = \"Wet or damp\" || RoadCollisions[Surface] = \"Frost or ice\" || RoadCollisions[Surface] = \"Snow\" || RoadCollisions[Surface] = \"Flood over 3 cm\"), SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Fatal collisions per 1,000 = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]), RoadCollisions[Severity] = \"1 Fatal\"), SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count])) * 1000",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Force latitude = AVERAGE(RoadCollisions[Force_lat])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Force longitude = AVERAGE(RoadCollisions[Force_lon])",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Collisions a month = DIVIDE(SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]), DISTINCTCOUNT(RoadCollisions[Date]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Rural share = DIVIDE(CALCULATE(SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]), RoadCollisions[Area] = \"Rural\"), SUM(RoadCollisions[Collision_count]))",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#22262A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
